    "updated_at": "2025-03-05T09:29:47Z",
    "body": "We need to rename `ShadowRoot.prototype.customElements` after all because some versions of scoped custom element registries polyfill written by Google is incompatible with having this property. For now I'm renaming it to `customElementRegistry` in https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/41910 but we can bikeshed the name.",
